                            <div id="collapsea7" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample2">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    Yes. Upon successful completion, you receive a verified certification in Embedded
                                    Systems &amp; IoT Engineering. More importantly, you'll have a GitHub portfolio of
                                    real device projects — which hiring managers value far more than any certificate
                                    alone. The two together make a compelling case.
